## What it does

- **Enquiry form** — parents register interest; auto-routed to taster booking or Academy waitlist using the UK Athletics 31 Aug age rule
- **Taster booking** — invite-token page with live capacity, Google Calendar confirmation
- **Academy waitlist** — U11 programme with accept/decline flow and annual season rollover
- **Membership** — OTP-gated form after first attended session; creates athlete record
- **Admin portal** — enquiry management, bookings, attendance, templates, config, reports
- **Coach app** — mobile session register with safeguarding audit trail (Cloudflare Access)
- **6 email types** — editable templates via Resend

