## Technology stack

| Layer | Technology | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| Framework | Astro 4 SSR | Pages + API catch-all |
| Hosting | Cloudflare Pages | Auto-deploy on push to main |
| API | Cloudflare Workers | All /api/* via Astro adapter |
| Database | Cloudflare D1 (SQLite) | 11 tables, environment-isolated |
| Cache | Cloudflare KV | Config + rate limiting |
| Email | Resend | 6 templates, editable in admin |
| Tests | Vitest + Miniflare | 231 tests, 8 files |
| Coach auth | Cloudflare Access | Zero Trust — email policy |

## Cost

Runs entirely within Cloudflare's free tier at expected volumes (< 200 enquiries/month).
**Total infrastructure cost: £0/month.**

